{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-experience the terrifying \u201cEscape the Ayurok\u201d through the perspective of a 90's horror video game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed Camera shots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory / Item mixing system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro cinematics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 3D character models</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ayurok mansion is now a horrifying retro place that will make you remember of the first horror videogames.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, this new installment brings all the original places and objectives to a new perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore all chapters through fixed cameras, solve more complex puzzles and even explore the game\u2019s lore to the old fashioned way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape as soon as you can while trying to survive in this<strong> immersive horror experience</strong> where the Ayurok can hear you through your mic.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1946310/e48450cae2b6389d002b0b3bea22714478c80975.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1946310/733bb5e5f6f31be840741bb90d71df9b190563a1.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1946310/451babe4e66305bc4cf49beabd9b6a39bc47658b.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1946310/0918f9f639771f121d155e26f0e246258c129ca5.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1946310/bfcfe53ec4771